  id: Desert_Cabin_4
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 4"
  content: "\tThe people from above say we'll reach the Fourth Heaven in three days.
    But the well that fed three generations of people here has gone completely dry.
    The island was cut from its underground veins when it separated from the earth
    below.\r\n\n\tWe are drifting toward God, dying of thirst."
